# Ignore everything unless it is part of the deliverable.
*

# Keep directories traversable so the whitelist below can admit their files.
!*/

# Deliverable whitelist
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Makefile
!assignment.txt
!app/**
!data/wordpress.sql
!docs/**
!scripts/**
!terraform/**

# Local and sensitive artifacts inside otherwise admitted directories
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.csr
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# This CA bundle is part of the immutable supplied WordPress tree.
!app/wp-includes/certificates/ca-bundle.crt

# Supplied archive and working notes
/site.tar.gz
/gpt-design.txt
/docs/points-to-return-to.txt
/.claude/
